# Landing SEO

- Do not add `/vs/` or `/alternatives/` pages until GSC indexed count is 40+ of the existing 88 sitemap URLs.
- Use `withPageSeo()` from `lib/seo.ts` on every page. Do not ship a page that inherits the root "Get early access" Twitter card.
- Do not restore `public/robots.txt`. `app/robots.ts` must win.
- No fabricated `AggregateRating` or review stars.
- No `installUrl` while `apps.shopify.com/pixel-tracker` is 404.
- Do not add Compare to the main nav.

```ts
// ✅ GOOD
export const metadata = withPageSeo("/docs", { title: "Docs", description: "..." });

// ❌ BAD
export const metadata = { title: "Docs" };
```
